Branchline adds a separate browser interface, accounts, authenticated gateway,
optional subscriptions, persisted jobs, deployment configuration and a hardened
engine entrypoint with private artifact cleanup. Its container installer uses
the matching official CPU PyTorch build with the other upstream lock versions.
The Docker image overlays the legacy Twitter launch script with a Branchline
shim that runs upstream's structured runner in Twitter-only mode. The shim is
included in deploy/run_twitter_simulation.py; the vendored source is unchanged.
